# ===== DO NOT IGNORE — THESE MUST GO TO GITHUB =====
# (Git tracks these automatically, listed here just as a reminder)
#
# data/training_queries_real.py        ✅ your query generator script
# models/svm_classifier.pkl            ✅ trained SVM model
# models/scaler.pkl                    ✅ feature scaler
# models/training_info.json            ✅ training metadata
# models/roman_urdu_dict_expanded.json ✅ Roman Urdu dictionary
# results/*.json                       ✅ evaluation results
# results/*.png                        ✅ charts and plots
# results/*.txt                        ✅ result logs
# notebooks/*.ipynb                    ✅ all your notebooks
# scripts/*.py                         ✅ utility scripts